                                "sense_id": "036efb46-8ddd-3d98-8342-5c48eb0b1fdb",
                                "text": "Although the supermarket tannoy was bravely broadcasting Rigoletto, its meat counter was thick with wurst and its wine shelves loaded with Liebfraumilch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d7a8dd2-49fb-438f-9c57-f0c412869afd",
                                "sense_id": "036efb46-8ddd-3d98-8342-5c48eb0b1fdb",
                                "text": "Terry Putnam, from Weymouth, adds: \"Riding home from Bristol a few days ago, as we approached Weymouth the guard announced over the tannoy 'The next station is Weymouth - please remember to take all your luggage and children with you...'\""
                            }
